    "description": "Course Description The Internet, web browsers, and web-page-development technology: web-page design and implementation with Hypertext Markup Language (HTML), CSS, and JavaScript utilizing a modern webpage design. Students will also get hands-on experience deploying their own website.\nCourse Overview This course.\nCourse Goals and Learning Outcomes Create valid HTML webpages using separation of concerns with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Design web pages with a focus on accessibility. Utilize CSS rules to create engaging and responsive web page designs. Use JavaScript to dynamically modify the structure and appearance of a webpage. Employ JavaScript to interact with Web APIs to exchange data. Think critically about web page design and apply industry standard web page design principles. Course Prerequisites None/varies by topic. Instructor permission required.",
